    LLM: "Draw from stock or discard LINE. Deepest card from line must form NEW meld immediately. First meld needs pure sequence. Sets (3-4 same rank) and Runs (3+ sequential same suit). Can rearrange own melds. Can't lay off on opponents. Jokers wild.",
    Player: "Draw from stock or discard LINE. Deepest card from line must form NEW meld immediately. First meld needs pure sequence. Sets (3-4 same rank) and Runs (3+ sequential same suit). Can rearrange own melds. Can't lay off on opponents. Jokers wild.",
    objective: 'Meld all cards into valid combinations (sequences and sets) and go out first by discarding your last card; or when the stock is exhausted, win by having the highest net score (meld value minus hand value).',
